  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;represents a circle with centre at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and radius&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;unit</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0015_f19c1007331b.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:2.68056in;height:2.06042in\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;represents twice the distance from the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence from the diagram,</p><p>&nbsp;<math><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>17</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>17</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><msqrt><mn>17</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>17</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p>"
  }
